  "sourceTitle": "Strawberry and Mint Frosty",
  "sourceText": "Strawberry and Mint Frosty\nBy: Lady Catherine ...\nPublished: Tuesday, June 5, 2012 - 11:29am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups of milk\n2 cups of fresh strawberries\n2 tablespoons honey\n2 tablespoons sugar\n1 inch piece of fresh ginger – sliced\nSmall handful of fresh mint\nJuice of ½ lemon or lime\n24 ice cubes\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a blender combine all of the above ingredients and blend until smooth and frosty.\n\nAbout\n\nThis drink is refreshing and satisfying and so easy to make.\nWith Love,\nCatherine\nxo",
